// Type-check view of the tracked SOURCE tree — KAN-530.
//
// Why this file exists, and why tsconfig.json excludes what it excludes:
//
//   tsconfig.json describes the BUILD INPUT for microbundle, whose entry is
//   src/index.ts. Storybook is a development surface, not part of the
//   published package, so `include: ["src"]` + `exclude: [... "src/stories"]`
//   is correct for the build. But nothing else type-checked those files
//   either: react-scripts test transpiles with babel-jest and Storybook builds
//   with webpack+babel, and BOTH strip types without checking them. So
//   .storybook/preview.tsx and src/stories/** — 3 tracked files — were checked
//   by no tool at all.
//
// This view re-includes them. `npm run typecheck` runs both configs and CI
// runs `npm run typecheck`.
//
// `dist` STAYS excluded, deliberately. Its 25 tracked .d.ts files are
// microbundle OUTPUT committed for consumers; type-checking generated
// artifacts tells you nothing about the source and would fail the gate on
// stale build output. `docs` (the built Storybook static site) is excluded for
// the same reason.
//
// DO NOT widen `exclude` to cover a source file to make a failure go away. An
// excluded file is an unchecked file, which is the exact defect this config was
// added to close. Fix the type error instead.
//
// KAN-695 additions:
//   `tests/**` and `vitest.config.ts` join the checked set for the same reason
//   the stories did -- vitest transforms with esbuild, which strips types without
//   checking them, so an untype-checked test file is an unchecked file.
//
//   `moduleResolution: "bundler"` overrides the build view's "node". vitest,
//   @vitest/coverage-v8 and @testing-library/* expose their types only through
//   package `exports` maps, which classic node resolution cannot read. This is
//   the DEV view; tsconfig.json keeps "node" so the microbundle build input is
//   resolved exactly as before.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "compilerOptions": {
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "types": ["vitest/globals", "@testing-library/jest-dom", "node"]
  },
  "include": ["src", "tests", ".storybook/preview.tsx", "vitest.config.ts"],
  "exclude": ["node_modules", "dist", "docs"]
}
